# (the user, 2026-10-28) SELECT on the Nachtfahrt page (HOME) is Energy, PERFORM's: 1 a detent (the screen shows
# twice), its value and a bar on the knobs' rule while it turns, said; not the tempo, not a level; the keys still
# play the Lead meanwhile; PERFORM's Energy knob shows the same value. Timewind (the tempo 96, the levels 60 70 40 60)
wait 300
listen
expect view 0
peakreset
key w2 down
wait 100
spin SELECT 6
wait 200
expect mac2 6
expect emac2 6
said ENERGY +12
expect par18 96
expect par0 60
expect par1 70
expect par2 40
expect par3 60
expect view 0
shot home_energy.png
wait 400
expect notes_ch3 >0
expect lastnote_ch3 >0
spin SELECT -10
wait 100
key w2 up
key w4 down
wait 100
expect notes_ch3 >1
key w4 up
wait 200
expect mac2 -4
said ENERGY -8
# the rule back to the page's after a moment
wait 1500
shot home_after.png
tap SEL
wait 300
expect view 17
expect mac2 -4
